olor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-15T15:57:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T11:21:15Z","closed_at":"2026-03-14T11:21:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439], v4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n\nIt's also Reproducible in the previous release v4.5.1.stable.mono.official [f62fdbde1] but with slightly different steps due to UI changes (see steps to reproduce)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21037.1004) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.94 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot crashes in the editor when changing the currently edited animation while at least two keyframes are selected in the Bezier curve editor.\n\n**Expected Behavior**: Godot should switch animations normally without crashing.\n\n**Actual Behavior:** Godot immediately crashes when switching animations.\n\nIn Godot 4.5.1. switching animation doesn't lead to a crash until the Bezier curve editor is togglet again (see steps to reproduce). This suggests the crash in 4.6 may be caused by the automatic reopening/refreshing of the Bezier editor rather than the animation change itself.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis can be easily reproduced in a new empty project:\n\n**In Godot 4.6:**\n1. Create a 3D Scene\n2. Add an animation player to the root node\n3. With the animation dock open, add a new animation called \"anim1\"\n4. Add a bezier curve track to \"anim1\", select the root Node3D and its posititon property, click \"open\"\n5. Right click on the track of position:x and \"Insert key...\"\n6. Repeat step 5 to add a second keyframe\n7. Add a second animation called \"anim2\"\n8. Add a bezier curve track to \"anim2\", select the root Node3D and its posititon property, click \"open\"\n9. Open \"anim1\" again\n10. Switch from the track editor to the bezier curve editor\n11. Select all of your keyframes\n12. Open \"anim2\" again\n13. Godot crashes\n\nIn Godot 4.5.1:\nIt's the same except after step 12 you have to toggle the Bezier curve editor again since it is not opened automatically when switching to a different animation. Godot still crashes.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus